1:# unreal-agent-tui design
2:
3:Decisions locked with the project owner; implement in this order.
4:
5:## Principles
6:
7:- Wrap the public unreal-agent harness; never fork it. If a feature needs
8:  harness internals, defer until upstream supports it.
9:- Mirror pi's UX where it is cheap to do so; diverge only where the harness
10:  differs.
11:
12:## Decisions
13:
14:| Area | Decision |
15:| --- | --- |
16:| Tool safety | Auto-run all tools (pi default: no per-call approval). Revisit later; if added, gate at the operation-manager wrapper. |
17:| Rendering | Assistant text rendered as markdown (glamour) with syntax highlighting; tool calls as collapsible cards; Edit/Write cards show colorized diffs. |
18:| Streaming | Tool calls and statuses render as they arrive. **Token streaming deferred**: upstream's `IncludePartialMessages` is accepted but ignored — the adapter only returns complete responses and its SSE parsing is internal. Re-evaluate when the harness emits partials. |
19:| Sessions | Slash commands: `/new`, `/resume`, `/model [id]`, `/quit`, `/help`. Session picker lists `<workspace>/.harness/sessions/*.session.jsonl` by mtime with first user input as title. |
20:| Provider | Selected at startup via flag/env; `/model` switches model id for subsequent turns. |
21:
22:## UI layout (alt-screen)
23:
24:```
25:┌ header ────────────────────────────────────────────┐
26:│ unreal-agent · workspace · model · session 1a2b3c4 │
27:├ transcript (viewport, scrolls, auto-follow) ───────┤
28:│ ❯ user prompt (bold)                               │
29:│ · reasoning summary (dim italic)                   │
30:│ ⚙ Bash (bash)                                      │
31:│ ┌ diff card: Edit main.go ─────────────────────┐   │
32:│ │ - old line        + new line                 │   │
33:│ └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
34:│ assistant markdown (glamour)                       │
35:├ status ────────────────────────────────────────────┤
36:│ working… · last turn: 1.2k in / 0.3k out           │
37:├ editor (grows 1–8 lines with content) ─────────────┤
38:│ ❯ _                                                │
39:└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
40:```
